    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d732">

                <pb facs="0826" n="741" sameAs="frus:frus1919v02/pg741"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">123H21/6: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Commission to Negotiate
                            Peace to the Acting Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-04-15T21:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">April 15, 1919,
                                9 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received April 16,
                            5.50 a.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>1626. The President has made the following recess appointments as Ministers: …
                    Hugh Gibson to Poland … Gibson has accepted.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d732-f1"/></p>
                <pb facs="0827" n="742" xml:id="pg742"/>
                <p>I took the liberty of asking Paderewski if Gibson would be acceptable and he said
                    that he would. …</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . .</p>
                <closer><signed>Lansing</signed><lb/><hi rendition="#small-caps">Am</hi>[<hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">erican</hi>] <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                        >Mission</hi></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d732-f1" n="1" xml:id="d732-f1-content">
                <p>His commission was issued Apr. 16.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
